2b:[["$","title","0",{"children":"2026 F1留学生没收入也要报税吗？不报税的后果惩罚？（附Form 8843 填报指南） · MapleWorld"}],["$","meta","1",{"name":"description","content":"2026年F1/J1 留学生没收入也要报税吗？是的！只要你在美国，即使零收入也必须在 4.15 前寄送 Form 8843。涵盖 F1/J1 身份及 STEM Extension 期间的申报注意事项，分析留学生不报税对未来 H1B 和绿卡申请的潜在惩罚与影响，助你合规完成 2026 年度税务申报。"}],["$","meta","2",{"name":"author","content":"MapleWorld Team"}],["$","meta","3",{"name":"keywords","content":"MapleWorld,2026 报税,Form 8843,留学生"}],["$","link","4",{"rel":"canonical","href":"https://www.mapleworld.online/form-8843-guide"}],["$","meta","5",{"property":"og:title","content":"MapleWorld - 2026 留学生报税指南"}],["$","meta","6",{"property":"og:description","content":"一站式解决留学生报税难题：Form 8843、W-2 缺失补救及身份自测。"}],["$","meta","7",{"property":"og:url","content":"https://www.mapleworld.online"}],["$","meta","8",{"property":"og:image","content":"https://www.mapleworld.online/og-image.png"}],["$","meta","9",{"property":"og:image:width","content":"1200"}],["$","meta","10",{"property":"og:image:height","content":"630"}],["$","meta","11",{"property":"og:image:alt","content":"MapleWorld · opt 留学生报税"}],["$","meta","12",{"property":"og:type","content":"website"}],["$","meta","13",{"name":"twitter:card","content":"summary_large_image"}],["$","meta","14",{"name":"twitter:title","content":"MapleWorld - 2026 留学生报税指南"}],["$","meta","15",{"name":"twitter:description","content":"一站式解决留学生报税难题：Form 8843、W-2 缺失补救及身份自测。"}],["$","meta","16",{"name":"twitter:image","content":"https://www.mapleworld.online/og-image.png"}],["$","meta","17",{"name":"twitter:image:width","content":"1200"}],["$","meta","18",{"name":"twitter:image:height","content":"630"}],["$","meta","19",{"name":"twitter:image:alt","content":"MapleWorld · opt 留学生报税"}],["$","link","20",{"rel":"icon","href":"/favicon.ico?favicon.ec1c61c1.ico","sizes":"256x256","type":"image/x-icon"}],["$","link","21",{"rel":"icon","href":"/favicon.ico"}],["$","$L2e","22",{}]]
